WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.950
A church, after a failed wedding.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.580
The groom and the princes have gone.

3
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.990
A young bride lies on the floor.

4
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.130
Her father stands over her.

5
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.350
He has heard a rumour about her.

6
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:18.180
And what he says is chilling: "Death
is the fairest cover for her shame".

7
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.620
So why would one rumour turn a
father against his own child?

8
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:26.240
In this mission, you'll find out
what honour meant in Messina,

9
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:28.570
for men, and for women.

10
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:31.580
You'll study his grief, line by line.

11
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:35.010
And you'll hear Beatrice's
fury in the church: "O!

12
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.690
that I were a man for his sake".

13
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.800
Your mission: explain why
Hero's father wishes her dead.
